# LOD-MANAGER: a dense Lat Long sphere's LOD chain in the LOD Manager - LOD0, LOD1, LOD2 previewed, each with fewer triangles
Дано run Panel "Open Modeling"
Дано run View "View mode: Lit"
Дано --subject viewport set Camera.Position 0,120,260
Дано --subject viewport set Camera.Direction 0,-0.25,-0.97
Дано --subject modeling set CreateShape.Sphere.Radius 60
Дано run Modeling "Create shape tool: Sphere"
Дано run Modeling "Create shape sphere: Lat Long"
Дано --subject modeling set CreateShape.Sphere.HorizontalSlices 64
Дано --subject modeling set CreateShape.Sphere.VerticalSlices 64
Дано run Modeling "Create shape: place at the viewport centre"
Дано --subject selection set Translation 0,40,0
Когда run Modeling "LOD Manager: open"
Когда run Modeling "LOD Manager: preview LOD 0"
Тогда 0_lod0 dense smooth sphere; the LOD Manager tab lists the levels with triangle counts, LOD0 the largest
Когда run Modeling "LOD Manager: preview LOD 1"
Тогда 1_lod1 the sphere visibly faceted; LOD1 radio selected, its triangle count below LOD0's
Когда run Modeling "LOD Manager: preview LOD 2"
Тогда 2_lod2 coarser again; LOD2 selected, fewer triangles than LOD1
Когда run Modeling "LOD Manager: preview Auto"
Когда run Modeling "LOD Manager: close"
